-25/38974897_794174735213402_5658923504426439013_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=u_94zyvWsQAQ7kNvwGuZd1B&_nc_oc=AdqyKH-zM_vISunHSyzFddi8x7sr2z9T6k79Qs05MpHlQJAfOE7VreVUs7MKBVTMYIY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6u3VaiFTGkP-S4QBvtP2qbxy0cn-TRkDile42eT2olNQ&oe=6A0B358C"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "vidthumb.png", "id": "419702353686012", "uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031447_419702357019345_1078684321555486491_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3ay336D5BTYQ7kNvwHQVjQc&_nc_oc=AdoBKsB7wWkXqcf5itr3nz7HSgOLUe1cqwWgvK3Uwdd3-zWtnNbO9sNjk-MoQ3PwdZc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4Cr_N1q7VR0L16waV6cc4HiqiyKqXaIMEfc3x2sujXbw&oe=6A0B2F80"}, "display_name": "FloatVR", "keywords": [], "long_description": "\u2605WHAT WILL YOU EXPERIENCE TODAY?\u2605\nFLOAT through a world generated anew every time you visit.\nLISTEN music arranged and composed especially for you. \nEXPAND your perspective with spoken observations.\nDISCOVER rare creatures and interactive objects.\n\u2193\n\u2605 HEALING: Experience an instant feeling of wellness\n\u2605 EVER CHANGING: Never experience the same thing twice\n\u2605 INFINITE: stay as long as you like.\n\u2193\nWhen you need to reset and recharge...\nWhen you need a break from your own thoughts...\nWhen you need to just BE...\nFLOAT IS ALWAYS HERE FOR YOU.  ", "short_description": "\u2605WHAT WILL YOU EXPERIENCE TODAY?\u2605\nFLOAT through a world generated anew every time you visit.\nLISTEN music arranged and composed especially for you. \nEXPAND your perspective with spoken observations.\nWATCH strange creatures doing their thing. \n\u2193\n\u2605 HEALING: Experience an instant feeling of wellness\n\u2605 EVER CHANGING: Never experience the same thing twice\n\u2605 INFINITE: stay as long as you like.\n\u2193\nWhen you need a break from your own thoughts...\nFLOAT IS ALWAYS HERE F